              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Nthawi ikubwera,\" akutero Yehova, \"pamene ndidzalanga onse amene anachita mdulidwe koma mu mtima sasamala nʼkomwe.",
          "type": "text",
