              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndidzalanga anthu a ku Igupto, Yuda, Edomu, Amoni, Mowabu, ndiponso onse amene amakhala kutali ku chipululu. Mitundu ina yonseyi ndi yosachita mdulidwe, ngakhalenso Aisraeli nawonso sanachite mdulidwe wa mu mtima.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
